{"about_the_game":"<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2115\ud835\udd56\ud835\udd60\u2102\ud835\udd52\ud835\udd63\ud835\udd64</h2></strong><br>Is a cyberpunk driving game that offers an immersive experience in a futuristic universe. <br>The game's concept is based on creating lines every time your car moves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/c6f5ca050785cad5005190125ba9e0b6.poster.avif?t=1759504141\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/c6f5ca050785cad5005190125ba9e0b6.webm?t=1759504141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/c6f5ca050785cad5005190125ba9e0b6.mp4?t=1759504141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------</h2><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud835\udd3b\ud835\udd63\ud835\udd5a\ud835\udd57\ud835\udd65</h2></strong><br>And you must skillfully drift to make these lines deadly for anything that passes through them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/59989a1edbdbc395a7f7dc5b36563b21.poster.avif?t=1759504141\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/59989a1edbdbc395a7f7dc5b36563b21.webm?t=1759504141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390490/extras/59989a1edbdbc395a7f7dc5b36563b21.mp4?t=1759504141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------</h2><br><strong><h2 class=